        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Every Combination\n\nPairs every item from one list with every item from another. Build this sweep before a batch of paid renders so you can see the count before you pay.\n\n**How it works:** \"Framings\" and \"Times\" each feed a \"Fan out\" node that emits their items one at a time. \"Cross\" pairs each framing with each time, producing six pairs. \"Framing\" and \"Time\" receive the two halves of every pair. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Add \"square\" to \"Framings\" and confirm the pair count rises from six to nine."
        },
